      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِمْطَرٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْطَرٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِمْطَرَةٌ</span></b>  (K)
<i>What is worn in rain, to protect one;</i> (S;) <i>a
garment of wool,</i> (K,) <i>worn in rain,</i> (TA,) <i>by
